<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade inactive in the Panhandle area Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers; following weekly movement of 85,300. - USDA</p>
<p>Confirmed: None     Week Ago: 9,300    Year Ago: None</p>
</text>
